1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 5=

2
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,400
Uncle.

3
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:11,790
About what happened
at the Imperial Retreat,

4
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,440
Xiaobai has already investigated it.

5
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,520
She said

6
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:16,640
someone tampered with the chandelier.

7
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,760
Xiaobai also said

8
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:19,560
it

9
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,080
wasn't Uncle He Dang's doing

10
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,880
because he's at the residence every day

11
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,760
and didn't

12
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,560
have time to commit the crime.

13
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,160
She also said

14
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,000
this

15
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,800
may have been aimed at you, Uncle,

16
00:01:29,890 --> 00:01:31,400
and told you to be extra careful.

17
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:32,960
Xiaobai?

18
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,960
Who is this Xiaobai?

19
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,800
She's my friend.

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,440
She's a legal advocate.

21
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,200
A female legal advocate?

22
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:40,640
Yes.

23
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,080
Impressive, isn't she?

24
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,120
Do you know

25
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,180
why, after all my years
as an official at court,

26
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,520
our family has remained

27
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,080
safe and sound to this day?

28
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,040
Acting impulsively

29
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:53,040
often does more harm than good.

30
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,870
What happened
at the Yushan Imperial Retreat

31
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,880
involves a death.

32
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,680
The court will investigate and handle it.

33
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,280
You children

34
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,160
should stay out of it.

35
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:03,920
Understood.

36
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,840
It's your move.

37
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,680
Your Highness.

38
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,400
The Vice Minister of War is here.

39
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,480
Show him in.

40
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,560
Since

41
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,120
you have matters to discuss,

42
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,560
I'll be going.

43
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,990
I'll play chess with you another day.

44
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,990
- Greetings, Prince Luan.
- Greetings, Prince Luan.

45
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,520
What brings you here?

46
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,440
Your Highness,

47
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,480
I'm afraid the Imperial Retreat case

48
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,720
isn't that simple.

49
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,960
What do you mean?

50
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,760
We believe

51
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:41,000
Lu Cen and the entire assassination plot

52
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,920
may well be connected

53
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,440
to Second Prince Songpiao.

54
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,000
Right now,

55
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,080
our colleagues are quite concerned.

56
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,360
Indeed, Your Highness.

57
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,560
Your Highness...

58
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:53,880
What's wrong?

59
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,400
What's so urgent?

60
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,550
Vice Minister Qian
from the Ministry of War

61
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,190
went to see my uncle
to discuss something.

62
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,600
It's perfectly normal
for officials to gather

63
00:03:03,610 --> 00:03:04,820
and discuss affairs of state.

64
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,280
But they were talking about you.

65
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,000
About me?

66
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,560
What did they say about me?

67
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,280
Official Qian said

68
00:03:11,510 --> 00:03:12,960
the assassination of the court official

69
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,200
was connected to you.

70
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,200
And...

71
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,800
What else?

72
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,480
Xiaobai also said

73
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,360
the Yushan Imperial Retreat case

74
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:21,820
had nothing to do with Uncle He Dang.

75
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,080
Cheng Fu

76
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:24,680
has a younger brother named Cheng Gui.

77
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,750
Cheng Gui was the contractor
for the Yushan Imperial Retreat.

78
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,280
So he's highly suspicious.

79
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:30,880
Yes.

80
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,520
I also think there's

81
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,880
more to this than meets the eye.

82
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,720
I hope they can find some new clues.

83
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,760
But Official Qian and the others...

84
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,680
At court,

85
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:44,900
everyone has their own faction.

86
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,960
Everyone has their own position.

87
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,160
Criticism, slander,

88
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,480
and false accusations

89
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,040
are nothing new to me.

90
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,560
Just don't let them bother you.

91
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,520
But I'm worried about you.

92
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,840
Silly girl.

93
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,400
Don't worry.

94
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,160
I'll make sure I stay safe.

95
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:04,640
By the way,

96
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,560
tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

97
00:04:07,110 --> 00:04:08,240
I'll take you out to relax.

98
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:08,920
Sure.

99
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,920
Then I'm bringing Sizhou along.

100
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,240
Invite whoever you like.

101
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,520
And Xiaobai too.

102
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:17,580
As long as you're happy.

103
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,760
I'll go tell them right now.

104
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,800
Good!

105
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,880
- Good!
- Good!

106
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,480
It's so beautiful.

107
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,840
Hurry up, everyone.

108
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,720
May we both be well for years to come,

109
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,300
and share the same moon
though a thousand miles apart.

110
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,600
I wonder if everyone back home

111
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,440
is looking at this same moon too.

112
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,560
Heavens,

113
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,680
why did you bring me to this world?

114
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,600
Miss Xiaobai.

115
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,160
You're here.

116
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:21,380
- You're alone?
- You're alone?

117
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:24,000
- Then why don't we go together...
- Why don't we go together...

118
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,920
- Actually, I'm waiting for some friends.
- Actually, I'm waiting for some friends.

119
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,480
Xiaobai!

120
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,320
(Why are those two together?)

121
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:36,560
Miss Xiaobai,
I have something to attend to.

122
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,360
I'll be going.

123
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,560
Don't go.

124
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,360
My friends are all here.

125
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,320
They're really nice.

126
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,160
Look at them.

127
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:42,270
They've been here for ages.

128
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:47,560
(Still trying to get away?)

129
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,600
Rousang.

130
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:49,880
Xiaobai.

131
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,280
Miss Xiaobai.

132
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,360
And this is?

133
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,520
This is my friend Sizhou.

134
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:57,960
These two are Songpiao

135
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:58,560
and Rousang.

136
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,640
This gentleman
has an extraordinary bearing.

137
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,560
One look at him

138
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:03,890
and you can tell he's no ordinary man.

139
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,120
By the way, Rousang,

140
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,720
it's the Mid-Autumn Festival today.

141
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,760
Young Master Sizhou
and Miss Jiang Xiaobai

142
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,920
have each other's company

143
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,990
to enjoy the garden and lanterns.

144
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,880
The two of us

145
00:06:14,150 --> 00:06:15,080
shouldn't disturb them,

146
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:15,720
right?

147
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,480
Not at all.

148
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,680
The more, the merrier.

149
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:21,360
Exactly. Xiaobai said
we should all go together,

150
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,360
so let's go together.

151
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,520
All right.

152
00:06:23,690 --> 00:06:24,920
Then I'll do as Rousang says.

153
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:25,920
Let's go.

154
00:06:25,930 --> 00:06:26,690
Let's have some fun.

155
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,160
Let's go.

156
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:33,920
Good!

157
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,560
Good!

158
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,200
Good!

159
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,280
One more!

160
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,080
- Good!
- Good!

161
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:38,880
Amazing!

162
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,900
(Joyous. Mid-Autumn Festival)

163
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:44,300
(Peace)

164
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,240
Look!

165
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:52,430
♪My heart gently stirs as you draw near♪

166
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:56,110
♪The starry sky I once gazed upon♪

167
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:59,260
♪Now falls into my eyes♪

168
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:03,160
♪The evening breeze
softly stirs my heartbeat♪

169
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:06,180
♪Even the silence feels so tender♪

170
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:09,770
♪I've imagined
our meeting countless times♪

171
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:12,580
♪Yet this moment
feels more vivid than a dream♪

172
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,040
♪When you take my hand♪

173
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,930
♪Fireworks bloom across the night sky♪

174
00:07:16,930 --> 00:07:18,580
♪Every other sight fades away♪

175
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,400
♪Leaving only your eyes♪

176
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,080
♪Moonlight falls upon my shoulder♪

177
00:07:22,090 --> 00:07:23,760
♪Happiness quietly finds its voice♪

178
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,680
♪The sweetest kind of tenderness♪

179
00:07:25,690 --> 00:07:27,420
♪Is simply being here with you♪

180
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,110
♪When you hold my hand tight♪

181
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,990
♪Starlight spills across the branches♪

182
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,760
♪The years drift slowly by♪

183
00:07:32,770 --> 00:07:34,340
♪Warmth fills my heart♪

184
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,230
♪The evening breeze kisses my brow♪

185
00:07:36,230 --> 00:07:38,060
♪Beautiful moments slowly come together♪

186
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:40,040
♪Along the long road that lies ahead♪

187
00:07:40,050 --> 00:07:42,010
♪May I stay by your side♪

188
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,080
He looks like a pretty honest man.

189
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,120
He doesn't look like the type either.

190
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:05,420
(Wanted Notice)

191
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,500
(Xichun Pavilion)

192
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,720
I don't remember him.

193
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,120
Do any of you remember him?

194
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,800
No.

195
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,720
You dropped something.

196
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,920
(That man is Cheng Gui.)

197
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,760
(He actually slipped away
right under my nose.)

198
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,120
It's him.

199
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:27,460
(Xichun Pavilion)

200
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,720
Xiaobai.

201
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,560
You bought some scented balm?

202
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,120
It's mint-scented.

203
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,160
That's unusual.

204
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,240
Unusual?

205
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,440
Although this scented balm

206
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,350
is sold in both
the Eastern and Western Markets,

207
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,480
this mint fragrance

208
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,920
is a specialty of Langjing Kingdom.

209
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,600
Langjing Kingdom?

210
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,890
That's right, Xiaobai.

211
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,990
You've never been
to Langjing Kingdom, have you?

212
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,000
Langjing Kingdom

213
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,480
can only be reached by boat.

214
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,000
Over here.

215
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,680
Put some speed into it.

216
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,880
Coming!

217
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,440
Yang Dou.

218
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,400
Give me a hand.

219
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,280
Miss Jiang.

220
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:09,080
Let's go.

221
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,680
Boss, a bowl of tea.

222
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,760
Are you heading out to sea again?

223
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,280
I have to make a living for my family.

224
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,480
It just means I won't

225
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,920
see my wife for several days again.

226
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:17,760
By the way,

227
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,290
Miss Jiang,

228
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,670
next time I come back
from Langjing Kingdom,

229
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,350
I'll bring you some fresh
seafood from there.

230
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,160
The fish there

231
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,080
is delicious.

232
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,760
Let's go.

233
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,360
Yang Dou.

234
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:25,840
Do you often sail to Langjing Kingdom?

235
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,640
Yes.

236
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,200
Has anyone named Cheng Gui

237
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:28,990
ever traveled on your boat?

238
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,000
Look.

239
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,200
This basket is broken.

240
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,600
You should know

241
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,160
I can tell when someone's lying.

242
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:41,240
Miss Jiang,

243
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,680
could you give me a hand

244
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,640
and help me carry this

245
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,400
over there?

246
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,160
Sure.

247
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,840
Yes.

248
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,960
Just put it here.

249
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,360
Miss Jiang,

250
00:10:07,370 --> 00:10:08,880
I really have nothing
to do with Cheng Gui.

251
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,800
Early that morning,

252
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,960
he came to my house

253
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,830
and said something had gone wrong
with his business in Langjing Kingdom

254
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,920
and he needed
to get back there urgently.

255
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,320
Take your time.

256
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,080
Don't worry.

257
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,200
I won't let an innocent person
be wrongly accused.

258
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,040
I'm just a boatman.

259
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,240
He offered me good money,

260
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:25,590
so of course I agreed to take him.

261
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,920
Who knew the authorities would
post a Wanted Notice the next day?

262
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:28,780
Miss Jiang,

263
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,040
you have to help me.

264
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:32,200
What if I end up
in court someday because of this...

265
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,680
This has nothing to do with you.

266
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:36,160
No one can give you trouble over it.

267
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:06,160
Who are you?

268
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,480
Watch out!

269
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:31,840
Sizhou!

270
00:11:36,780 --> 00:11:39,020
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

271
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,760
Rousang and I
both believe He Dang is innocent.

272
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,240
He was simply in the wrong place

273
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,800
at the wrong time.

274
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:46,920
But to prove that,

275
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:47,960
we need evidence.

276
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,360
And right now, all the evidence

277
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,920
points to Cheng Gui,
the victim Cheng Fu's younger brother.

278
00:11:54,060 --> 00:11:55,890
Your investigation
into the Imperial Retreat case

279
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,840
caught Lu Cen's attention.

280
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:02,360
There was a last-minute substitution
at the lighting ceremony,

281
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,520
and Cheng Fu ended up
dying in Prince Luan's place.

282
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,840
Lu Cen's targets all along

283
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,200
have been court officials.

284
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,520
Cheng Gui and Lu Cen must be connected.

285
00:12:11,530 --> 00:12:13,360
Otherwise, why would
he try to kill me today?

286
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,640
Now it all makes sense.

287
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,520
Jiang Xiaobai.

288
00:12:19,140 --> 00:12:20,800
You need to stop
investigating this case.

289
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,320
Why?

290
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,080
Because

291
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:26,520
this is a matter for the authorities.

292
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,520
What's more,
once court officials are involved,

293
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,200
whatever comes next

294
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,240
will only become more dangerous.

295
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,440
I don't look for trouble,
but I don't fear it either.

296
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,480
Lu Cen has killed countless people.

297
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:38,040
The fact that
you made it back alive today

298
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,240
was sheer luck.

299
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,560
So you know how dangerous he is.

300
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,160
You were badly injured today.

301
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,080
If anything had happened to you,

302
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:43,760
if it had been any worse,

303
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:44,690
what would I have done?

304
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,680
That's because
you don't know your limits.

305
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:48,480
You keep interfering in cases
that aren't your concern

306
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,520
and provoking people you shouldn't.

307
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,880
So I'm supposed to stand by
while innocent people are wronged?

308
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,440
Then what about you?

309
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,840
If I were afraid of such things,

310
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,390
I wouldn't have become a legal advocate.

311
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,240
Jiang Xiaobai!

312
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,160
I'm sorry.

313
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,320
I...

314
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,280
I just don't want

315
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,400
you to be in danger.

316
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:14,600
Don't worry.

317
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:16,640
Fortune favors people like me.

318
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:19,720
Uncle.

319
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,600
You must be extra careful.

320
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:24,240
Lu Cen's real target may be you.

321
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:30,200
Lu Cen and the entire assassination plot

322
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,360
may well be connected

323
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,960
to Second Prince Songpiao.

324
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,640
(You want to make trouble for me?)

325
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,920
(It won't be that easy.)

326
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,960
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

327
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:51,310
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

328
00:13:51,950 --> 00:13:53,710
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

329
00:13:53,710 --> 00:13:56,630
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

330
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:01,500
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

331
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:05,180
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

332
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:07,350
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

333
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:10,850
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

334
00:14:13,590 --> 00:14:16,460
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

335
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:20,070
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

336
00:14:20,510 --> 00:14:23,130
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

337
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:27,160
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

338
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:30,450
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

339
00:14:30,820 --> 00:14:33,500
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

340
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:36,250
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

341
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:39,470
♪I'll only say that once♪

342
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,710
♪I called your name♪

343
00:14:46,330 --> 00:14:48,540
♪The silent stars hang low♪

344
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:52,170
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

345
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:55,300
♪I linger in the old tower♪

346
00:14:55,450 --> 00:14:59,080
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

347
00:15:00,390 --> 00:15:02,850
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

348
00:15:03,730 --> 00:15:06,510
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

349
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,520
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

350
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:15,760
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

351
00:15:16,020 --> 00:15:18,900
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

352
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:23,000
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

353
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,640
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

354
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:29,930
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

355
00:15:29,930 --> 00:15:32,840
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

356
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,990
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

357
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:38,660
♪If we meet again in another life♪

358
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:41,710
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

359
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,690
♪Was when we first met?♪

360
00:15:45,970 --> 00:15:48,350
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

361
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:51,240
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
